The verifier and this consumer share one process while the verifier's locks are
held.  The consumer creates a private index from the captured HEAD, inserts only
content-addressed verified blobs, runs an immutable snapshot of the repository
pre-commit gate against that index, creates a commit object with ``commit-tree``
and advances HEAD with one compare-and-swap ``update-ref``.  No porcelain commit,
commit-msg/post-commit hook, intent-to-add, reusable receipt or argv-controlled
callback belongs to this path.

This command commits internal editorial stock only.  It never promotes,
publishes, renders or changes an index policy.
"""

